779
00:41:47.750 --> 00:41:49.833
He's not the boss. I'm the boss out here.

780
00:41:50.541 --> 00:41:51.541
Put it down.

781
00:41:52.041 --> 00:41:53.041
That's better.

782
00:41:53.125 --> 00:41:54.125
