821
00:43:29.500 --> 00:43:30.666
Fucking asshole.

822
00:43:31.791 --> 00:43:34.708
You shouldn't be in this industry
but in a mental asylum.

823
00:43:34.791 --> 00:43:38.125
This industry is a mental asylum.

824
00:43:38.208 --> 00:43:41.000
