-I will shoot, Anurag.

825
00:43:41.083 --> 00:43:43.583
I won't hesitate to shoot.

826
00:43:43.666 --> 00:43:46.166
So shoot me.
You'll still have to find Sonam.

827
00:43:46.250 --> 00:43:48.166
