949
00:51:12.791 --> 00:51:14.083
Yogita, come here.

950
00:51:14.958 --> 00:51:16.000
Sir…

951
00:51:16.958 --> 00:51:19.833
you have to talk.

952
00:51:21.916 --> 00:51:23.958
