Once again, the hero is needed.

967
00:52:14.916 --> 00:52:17.583
Hey, man, do you know him?

968
00:52:19.791 --> 00:52:22.416
Yes, motherfucker,
it's my left testicle. I massage it daily.

969
00:52:22.500 --> 00:52:24.166
At least look at it!

970
00:52:28.083 --> 00:52:31.291
